June 19 Afternoon Analysis
Hope everyone's Dragon Boat Festival is going well! Currently, the day trading is showing minimal volatility.
Target: $BTC . The overall market is experiencing continuous net outflows, with large funds leaning towards reducing their positions and exiting;
The upper Bollinger band at 63011 is facing strong selling pressure. A breakout to the upside must be accompanied by volume; otherwise, it could easily face resistance and pull back;
The daily candlestick is bearish. This 15-minute bounce is merely a technical correction after the drop and hasn't formed a trend reversal signal yet. For short-term trading, I recommend ranging between 63000-63800, targeting around 62500-62000 near #BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析 .
